# ripgrep/fd ignore file (git does NOT read this — .gitignore is separate).
# Purpose: make lazar SEE its own work with bare `rg`. lazar's working dirs
# (workspace/ memory/ skills/ logs/) are gitignored as runtime state, and rg
# respects .gitignore — so before this file, a bare `rg` was blind to lazar's
# own files (it insisted a real pricing-component page didn't exist, 2026-07-08).
# This file (higher precedence than .gitignore) re-includes those work dirs for
# search, while still excluding the multi-GB caches/artifacts so searches stay
# fast and relevant. git tracking is unchanged.

# Re-include lazar's real work dirs (override .gitignore, for rg only).
!workspace/
!memory/
!skills/
!logs/

# ...but keep the heavy caches/artifacts out of searches.
workspace/cargo-target/
workspace/.cargo-target/
workspace/gocache/
workspace/.gocache/
workspace/gomodcache/
workspace/.gomodcache/
workspace/gopath/
workspace/.gopath/
workspace/kernel-backups/
workspace/web-fetch-cache/
workspace/.cargo-target*/
src/target/
logs/*.bak
logs/*.bak.gz
